  "result_tail": " session log written by the project's own hook. I left it alone.\n\n## Choices the task left open\n\n- **Order and duplicates**: each page is listed once, in ascending order, so `\"5,1-3\"` gives `[1, 2, 3, 5]` and overlapping parts don't repeat a page. If the dialog should print in the order typed, or print repeats, that is a small change — say if you want it.\n- **Spaces**: spaces around a part or around the dash are ignored, so `\"1 - 3, 5\"` works.\n- **Backwards ranges**: `\"5-3\"` throws a `RangeError`.\n- **Empty input**: an empty text or an empty part (`\"\"`, `\"1,,3\"`, `\"1,\"`) throws a `RangeError`.",
